message.content:
{
  "summary": "This bill would require school directors for local education agencies (LEAs) and public charter schools to immediately notify all students, parents, educators, employees, and contractors if an immigration officer is on the school grounds. The bill defines an immigration officer as any state, local, or federal law enforcement officer seeking to enforce immigration law. It specifies that this notification requirement and any related policies are not considered sanctuary policies and do not subject school officials or employees to penalties associated with sanctuary policies. This act would take effect upon becoming law."
}
